15: Method `Symfony\Component\Notifier\Bridge\Slack\SlackOptions::channel()` is removed: call `recipient()`, which sends the message to that channel; `channel()` has set nothing since Symfony 5.1, so the message went to the channel of the DSN, since symfony/slack-notifier 6.0.
